on\":\"`XYNOLOG_OIDC_CLIENT_KEY` is unset or empty.\",\"refusal\":\"XYNOLOG_OIDC_CLIENT_KEY is not set in the worker's environment: a worker signs in as a service account\"},{\"name\":\"key-unreadable\",\"situation\":\"`XYNOLOG_OIDC_CLIENT_KEY` is not a PEM private key the service can read without a passphrase.\",\"refusal\":\"XYNOLOG_OIDC_CLIENT_KEY in the worker's environment is not an unencrypted PEM private key\"},{\"name\":\"key-not-rsa\",\"situation\":\"`XYNOLOG_OIDC_CLIENT_KEY` is a private key that is not RSA.\",\"refusal\":\"XYNOLOG_OIDC_CLIENT_KEY in the worker's environment is not an RSA key: a worker signs its assertions with RS256\"},{\"name\":\"api-key-unset\",\"situation\":\"An engine names, by its `apiKeyEnv`, a variable that is unset or empty: `{knowledgeBase}` is the index of its knowledge base in `knowledgeBases`, and `{engine}` its index in that one's `engines`, each in decimal digits.\",\"refusal\":\"knowledgeBases[{knowledgeBase}].engines[{engine}].apiKeyEnv names a variable that is not set in the worker's environment\"},{\"name\":\"domain-twice\",\"situation\":\"Two of `knowledgeBases` name one `domain`: `{later}` is the index of the later, and `{earlier}` of the earlier, each in decimal digits.\",\"refusal\":\"knowledgeBases[{later}].domain is the domain of knowledgeBases[{earlier}]: a worker serves a knowledge base once\"},{\"name\":\"none-admits\",\"situation\":\"Every knowledge base refused the service before any was confirmed.\",\"refusal\":\"No knowledge base admits this worker: each of its knowledgeBases refused it\"},{\"name\":\"cannot-listen\",\"situation\":\"The service cannot listen on its `port`: `{port}` is the port, in decimal digits, and `{why}` the system's reason, which varies.\",\"refusal\":\"Cannot listen on port {port}: {why}\"}],\"reasons\":[{\"name\":\"missing\",\"situation\":\"An object without a member its schema requires: `{member}` is the member's name.\",\"line\":\"  Missing required property: {member}\"},{\"name\":\"other\",\"situation\":\"Any other way the document is not its schema's: `{member}` is the names on the way from the document to the member, joined by `.`, with no index of an array.\",\"line\":\"  {member}: is not what the schema states\"}],\"job\":{\"mark\":\"mark ({motivation})\",\"yield\":\"yield\"},\"errors\":[{\"name\":\"unextractable\",\"situation\":\"A job on a resource whose media type has no text the worker can read: `{resourceId}` is the resource, and `{mediaType}` its media type.\",\"error\":\"Cannot run {job} on resource {resourceId}: media type '{mediaType}' has no extractable text to analyze\"},{\"name\":\"not-settled\",\"situation\":\"A job on a resource whose anchored text the Smelter has not yet settled: `{resourceId}` is the resource.\",\"error\":\"Anchored text not yet derived for resource {resourceId} — Smelter has not settled; retrying\"},{\"name\":\"anchored-declined\",\"situation\":\"A job on a resource the anchored-text consult declines: `{resourceId}` is the resource, and `{declined}` what the consult answered, `no-map` or `unknown`.\",\"error\":\"Cannot run {job} on resource {resourceId}: anchored-text consult returned '{declined}'\"},{\"name\":\"not-served\",\"situation\":\"A job of a motivation the engine that took it does not serve.\",\"error\":\"Worker not configured for job: {job}\"},{\"name\":\"no-processor\",\"situation\":\"A tagging job handed over without the schema it names.\",\"error\":\"No processor for job: {job}\"},{\"name\":\"window-too-small\",\"situation\":\"A model whose window leaves a piece 64 tokens or fewer: `{contextTokens}` is the window, `{scaffoldTokens}` the tokens of the prompt without its piece, and `{inputBudget}` what is left, each in decimal digits.\",\"error\":\"Inference window too small for detection: context {contextTokens} tokens minus scaffold {scaffoldTokens} leaves an input budget of {inputBudget} (need > 64). Use a model with a larger context window or reduce the prompt scaffold.\"},{\"name\":\"ollama-refused\",\"situation\":\"An Ollama engine's generation refused: `{status}` is the status, and `{body}` the body, as it was sent.\",\"error\":\"Ollama API error ({status}): {body}\"},{\"name\":\"anthropic-refused\",\"situation\":\"An Anthropic engine's request refused: `{said}` is what its client says of the refusal, which varies, and carries the refusal's status and the words of its body's `error.message`.\",\"error\":\"{said}\"},{\"name\":\"unreadable\",\"situation\":\"An answer that cannot be read: `{detail}` is one of `details`, and `{stopReason}` why the model stopped, `end_turn` where an Ollama engine's says `stop`.\",\"error\":\"Structured response could not be read: {detail} (stop_reason: {stopReason})\"},{\"name\":\"wait-stated\",\"situation\":\"A refusal whose stated wait is over 120 seconds: `{failure}` is the refusal's error, `anthropic-refused` or `anthropic-limits-refused`, and `{said}` one of `waits`.\",\"error\":\"{failure}; the provider said to wait ({said}), which is longer than the 120 seconds this driver waits\"},{\"name\":\"withheld\",\"situation\":\"An answer the provider withheld: `{why}` is ` ({category})` where it states a category and `: {explanation}` where it states an explanation, in that order, each left out where it states none.\",\"error\":\"The provider withheld its answer: refusal{why}\"},{\"name\":\"no-structured-outputs\",\"situation\":\"A mark job on an Anthropic model the Models API does not report strict structured outputs for: `{model}` is the model.\",\"error\":\"Model '{model}' does not report support for strict structured outputs (Models API capabilities.structured_outputs). It is refused: a generation the provider does not hold to the schema can come back unreadable. Give the agent that does this work a model that reports supported: true.\"},{\"name\":\"ollama-limits-refused\",\"situation\":\"`/api/show` refused: `{model}` is the model, `{status}` the status, and `{said}` the body, as it was sent.\",\"error\":\"Failed to discover model limits for '{model}' from Ollama's /api/show: refused with status {status}: {said}\"},{\"name\":\"anthropic-limits-refused\",\"situation\":\"The Models API refused: `{model}` is the model, `{status}` the status, and `{said}` what `anthropic-refused` says of the refusal.\",\"error\":\"Failed to discover model limits for '{model}' from the Models API: refused with status {status}: {said}\"},{\"name\":\"no-context-length\",\"situation\":\"`/api/show` answered with no context length: `{model}` is the model.\",\"error\":\"/api/show reports no context length for '{model}'\"},{\"name\":\"unsupported-output\",\"situation\":\"A yield job for a media type the worker does not generate: `{mediaType}` is the job's `outputMediaType`, and `{generatable}` each media type media-types/registry.json says is generatable, in its order, joined by ` or `.\",\"error\":\"Unsupported outputMediaType for generation: {mediaType}. Generation produces {generatable}.\"},{\"name\":\"over-window\",\"situation\":\"A yield job whose prompt and length are together over its model's window: `{promptTokens}` is the tokens of the prompt, `{maxTokens}` the job's `maxTokens`, `{model}` the model, and `{contextTokens}` its window, each number in decimal digits.\",\"error\":\"The prompt (~{promptTokens} tokens) and the {maxTokens} tokens asked for are together over the context window of '{model}' ({contextTokens} tokens)\"}],\"details\":[{\"name\":\"not-json\",\"situation\":\"An answer that is not JSON.\",\"detail\":\"response is not valid JSON\"},{\"name\":\"not-array\",\"situation\":\"An answer that is JSON and not an array: `{kind}` is what it is, `object`, `string`, `number`, `boolean` or `null`.\",\"detail\":\"parsed to {kind}, not an array\"},{\"name\":\"empty\",\"situation\":\"An answer with no text.\",\"detail\":\"response is empty\"}],\"waits\":[{\"name\":\"seconds\",\"situation\":\"A `retry-after` of `{seconds}`, as it was sent.\",\"said\":\"retry-after: {seconds}\"},{\"name\":\"milliseconds\",\"situation\":\"A `retry-after-ms` of `{milliseconds}`, as it was sent.\",\"said\":\"retry-after-ms: {milliseconds}\"}],\"logged\":[{\"name\":\"confirmed\",\"level\":\"info\",\"situation\":\"A knowledge base confirmed: `{domain}` is its domain, and `{did}` the DID it names the worker by.\",\"message\":\"Knowledge base confirmed\",\"fields\":{\"domain\":\"{domain}\",\"did\":\"{did}\"},\"carries\":[]},{\"name\":\"refused\",\"level\":\"error\",\"situation\":\"A knowledge base that refused the worker: `{domain}` is its domain. `reason` says why.\",\"message\":\"Knowledge base refused the worker\",\"fields\":{\"domain\":\"{domain}\"},\"carries\":[\"reason\"]},{\"name\":\"trouble\",\"level\":\"warn\",\"situation\":\"A knowledge base in trouble, which the worker starts again: `{domain}` is its domain. `error` says what the trouble was, and `waitMs` how long it waits, in milliseconds.\",\"message\":\"Knowledge base in trouble — starting it again\",\"fields\":{\"domain\":\"{domain}\"},\"carries\":[\"error\",\"waitMs\"]}]}",
